    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend part X of chapter 62 of the laws of 2003 amending the general\nbusiness law and other laws generally relating to implementing the state\nfiscal plan for the 2003-2004 state fiscal year, in relation to extending\ncertain provisions of the general municipal law and the local finance law\nrelating to electronic bidding",
